{"id":"wb-3-97","name":"何园","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"何园","text":"何园，又名寄啸山庄，位于中华人民共和国江苏省扬州市徐凝门大街66号，被誉为“晚清第一园”。1988年列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。同时还是国家AAAA级旅游景区以及国家重点公园。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BD%95%E5%9B%AD","revisionId":92116206,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92116206","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/09c47aa49ee2db5c59274bc7.jpg","title":"He_Garden.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:He_Garden.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/07/He_Garden.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Gisling","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"​扬州何园","width":320,"height":240}}